## Slide 13

SPC Script Events

The following transitions are monitored by the Logic Service for SPC Sample Sub-Group records…
On Created
The following transitions are monitored by the Logic Service for SPC Rule records…
On Rule (Fail)
TrakSYS allows for these transitions to be used to trigger real-time functionality such as…
Email Notifications
Entity Script Class Events

